    The native manifest contracts (tokens, utilities, icons) also carry a
    local <code>Deprecated</code> alias that <code>$ref</code>s
    <code>lifecycle.json#/definitions/Deprecated</code>, and the DTCG
    extensions schema aliases its local <code>Deprecated</code> to
    <code>StrictDeprecated</code> — one canonical record shape per
    namespace, defined once here.
  </p>
